      "output_tokens": 296,
      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_c390b0cb2a8708d8_0",
        "edit": "In the combinational always block, invert the enable condition from `if(ena)` to `if(!ena)` so that y is forced to 0 when ena is low and the one-hot decode is applied when ena is high, matching the oracle behavior.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "\n\nmodule decoder3e_test(a,ena,y);\n  input [2:0] a;\n  input ena;\n  output reg [7:0] y; \n\n  \n\n\nalways @(*)begin\n  if(!ena) y = 0;\n  else begin\n    case(a)\n        3'b000: y = 8'b0000_0001;\n        3'b001: y = 8'b0000_0010;\n        3'b010: y = 8'b0000_0100;\n        3'b011: y = 8'b0000_1000;\n        3'b100: y = 8'b0001_0000;\n        3'b101: y = 8'b0010_0000;\n        3'b110: y = 8'b0100_0000;\n        3'b111: y = 8'b1000_0000;\n    \n    endcase\n  end\nend\n\n\n\n\n\nendmodule\n",
        "slot_index": 0
      },
      "patch_payload_hash": "sha256:cace0e163c4f39bfaaa831eced6d02b779c7b3deea9fc349d33e85513dac71c4",
      "prompt_hash": "sha256:275e9a05cc673dadaac8a6514b6099a35a6b695f56c237408254f8204a965e14",
